#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "40432"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF is right.\nLet's head back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "40968"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF is right there.\nLet's #C000246204press on#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "41988"
msgid "We obtained the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nLet's go back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "42280"
msgid "Apocalypse Now!\nCome back soooooooon!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "42748"
msgid "Surely you aren't thinking of WALKING back?\nDo you intend to make me march for no purpose?\nLook for that #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "43660"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF is right.\nLet's head back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and get some rest."
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1659
msgctxt "47888"
msgid "　Obtained\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF."
msgstr "　Obtido:\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF."

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "47932"
msgid "Obtained"
msgstr "Obtido"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "649676"
msgid "Sleeping? Where?\nHuh, the Infirmary?\nHm, they have one of those here?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "649756"
msgid "Well, your dimwitted self WOULD\njump in bed as soon as you got here!\nYou never fail to be third rate."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650792"
msgid "Thanks for the concern. That I don't need.\nI always go at it alone.\nGames are best played solo."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651396"
msgid "Huh? A Servant?\nYou have Servant with you!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651564"
msgid "I ask about #C236196003Shinji#CDEF's Servant, and…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651676"
msgid "I feel like that golden Servant isn't a \"traditional\" Servant,\nbut we pretty much made a contract."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651776"
msgid "#C236196003Shinji#CDEF's astonishment was closer to fear than confusion.\nI ask about #C236196003Shinji#CDEF's Servant, and…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652680"
msgid "And the loser gets――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652720"
msgid "Hmph.\n\"When you lose, you die,\" right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653232"
msgid "If we leave this structure and\ngo to some other area,\nwe'll reconnect in a flash. Definitely."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653416"
msgid "After all, the biggest contender―me―is here.\nManagement wouldn't abandon a star,\nnow would they?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "672496"
msgid "Her?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "672508"
msgid "Who?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "672520"
msgid "Sakura?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672532"
msgid "By \"her\" I mean HER, #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF!\nThe drain-lady who made a complete fool\noutta me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672924"
msgid "#C236196003Shinji#CDEF asks me for battle data on #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673004"
msgid "…oh, yeah.\n#C236196003Shinji#CDEF wasn't there when #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF attacked us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673660"
msgid "I speak about her basic stats,\nas well as the special skills she had used――\n\"Drain\" and \"#C000246204Invincibility#CDEF.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674296"
msgid "Eh? You weren't attacked this time?\nShe's straight up snubbing you!\nYou don't even qualify as an enemy to her!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675020"
msgid "But still――\nYou'll go back to the Near Side?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675212"
msgid "I should――"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "675256"
msgid "I still have to stop BB."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676132"
msgid "Most likely――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676148"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF, #C236196003Rani#CDEF, #C236196003Jinako#CDEF―― Everyone is worried."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676508"
msgid "Don't go into the Labyrinth anymore!\nIf you piss off #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF,\nshe'll come down on us, too!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676684"
msgid "We're down to four people…\nIf you disappear, too…\nWhat the hell will we do…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676900"
msgid "That's what #C236196003BB#CDEF kept warning us to do."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "682764"
msgid "Damn, they even went as far as\nshutting the blinds.\nThat #C236196003Leo#CDEF, what're you tryin' to hide?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "683128"
msgid "I guess I'll try calling out to him."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "683204"
msgid "Good morning～!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "683228"
msgid "Whaddafu――!? D-damn, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF!\nWh-why are you……!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "683532"
msgid "Nope."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "683544"
msgid "\"Nope\"!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "684012"
msgid "…………hey."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "684196"
msgid "…………woah."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "684212"
msgid "\n\nSo he is interested, after all."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "728896"
msgid "Stay in this dungeon."
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "729112"
msgid "Hyaa!? N-no…!\nPlease don't run so fast…!"
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "729232"
msgid "A-ah, um, well… something tickled…"
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "729272"
msgid "I'm sorry, if only I could control myself…"
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "729364"
msgid "Kya!? N-nothing, please ignore that!!"
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "729536"
msgid "Sightsee while you can, antler girl!\nLet's fight, Darling!"
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "729756"
msgid "A-ahh!!! Please… be gentle…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "730744"
msgid "#C236196003E-Elizabeth#CDEF!?\nShe's a #C000246204Sentinel#CDEF of the Labyrinth―\nWhy is she #RUBS             here#RUBEinside #C236196003Sakura#CDEF!?#REND"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "731012"
msgid "Manager… Her Master changed…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "731056"
msgid "Then she's no longer #C236196003Shinji#CDEF's Servant,\nshe's #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "731364"
msgid "N-nanosize…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "731520"
msgid "――――I get it.\nYour body is in the Student Council Room.\nOnly your soul was sent in…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "731840"
msgid "Kill instantly…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "731956"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF said so.\n\"You can have this body.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "732024"
msgid "This girl won't turn into #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF,\nshe'll turn into #C236196003Elizabeth Báthory#CDEF!\nThen I'll be back in business!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "732456"
msgid "\"I mixed in a special bee.\"\nI'm certain #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF mentioned that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "732636"
msgid "I refuse…\nMe, become my Senpai's enemy…\nI don't… want that…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "732708"
msgid "Oh? Still conscious, are we?\nNot bad. Stiiilllll."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "732768"
msgid "Kya……!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "733272"
msgid "#C236196003#NICK#CDEF, hurry!\nThe virus is spreading faster!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "733644"
msgid "Hm!? A trap!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "733660"
msgid "Hm…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "733936"
msgid "Hee hee hee. How does it taste―\nmy Special Sugar Cage?\nSuper sugary and sweet, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "734128"
msgid "But… #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF.\nYou're no Lancer, are you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "734292"
msgid "That aside… I knew it.\nYour class isn't #C236196003Lancer#CDEF anymore, is it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "734860"
msgid "Now my class is―yes―Idol!\n\"In one sense, you're lost in your\nown little world, so it fits.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "734956"
msgid "…that's what #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF said, then she\nchanged my class for me. I didn't really\nmind being recycled."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "735104"
msgid "So, I wonder what #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF's class is now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "735520"
msgid "There's the peanut gallery… I'm going to\nmeasure #[piggy][squirrely]#'s smarts for you.\nBe thankful."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "735912"
msgid "U-umm. I'll let you take it from here, Darling鷙\nI'll be right behind you!"
msgstr ""

#. popupStd
msgctxt "736196"
msgid "#C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF's puzzle:"
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line2
msgctxt "736300"
msgid "red, blue, and yellow."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "736332"
msgid "Pressing a #C000246204red#CDEF switch"
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line2
msgctxt "736372"
msgid "will open one red door."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "736396"
msgid "Pressing a #C000246204blue#CDEF switch"
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line2
msgctxt "736548"
msgid "another yellow door will close."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "736872"
msgid "Now I'm the singing, dancing, #RUBS Berserker#RUBElunatic#REND idol:\n#C236196003Elizabeth Báthory#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "736976"
msgid "U-unbelievable! A dragon AND a Berserker!?\nThat sounds way too powerful…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "737140"
msgid "…you really are lost in your own little world.\nI get #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's sarcasm."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "737908"
msgid "………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "737924"
msgid "………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "737940"
msgid "………………wow."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "737960"
msgid "………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "737976"
msgid "………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "738540"
msgid "I'm headache-prone myself,\nso I kind of get how you feel."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "738852"
msgid "H-HUHHH!?\nU-umm… I'm an AI, so…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "738904"
msgid "Wow."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "739076"
msgid "Oh, my."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "739304"
msgid "Forever."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "739340"
msgid "Exactly! That's my #[piggy][squirrely]# for you!\nThanks!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "739400"
msgid "I'm in a good mood now, so I think I'll head\nback and take a bloodbath.\nSee ya!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "739484"
msgid "Huh. Seriously…? Thirty?\nIsn't that way too soon…… ah!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "739544"
msgid "Y-y-y-yeah, yeah that's right!\nI think so, too!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "739784"
msgid "――――erm.\nWhy?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "739816"
msgid "I just went and answered out of reflex,\nmaybe because #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF sounded so honest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "740076"
msgid "Wh――what's wrong with this planet――!?\nI'm destroying it now! I agree with #C236196003BB#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "740372"
msgid "Pft. Pffffffffffttt.\nAhahahahahahahaha!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "740460"
msgid "Ah, sorry, ahem. Umm. Oh, #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF.\nShe was acting unexpectedly uptight, wasn't she?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "741572"
msgid "………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "741648"
msgid "I-it's you…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "741668"
msgid "#C236196003Shinji#CDEF!? What are you doing here…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "741724"
msgid "…………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "741744"
msgid "…#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF got me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "741992"
msgid "#C236196003Shinji#CDEF snickers."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "742272"
msgid "………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "742548"
msgid "How can I abandon such a being?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "742728"
msgid "Be thankful to #C236196003#NICK#CDEF and #C236196003Kiara#CDEF.\nWe have the software to convert you even after\nyou've turned into a virus."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "743372"
msgid "You've finally made it.\nBut the flukes end here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "744496"
msgid "Wow."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "744596"
msgid "Mhm. Leave everything to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "745048"
msgid "Have you never had a boyfriend before?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "745104"
msgid "Wha――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "745220"
msgid "Hehehehehe…\nYou won't be talking your way out of\nthat reaction. Praetor, now!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "745300"
msgid "Wh―sto―wait, wait a second!\nMe, a virgin!? AS IF!!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "745632"
msgid "I see, so it really was the case.\nMhm. No matter. I don't mind, I love it!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "745712"
msgid "………huh!? W-w-w-what are you saying,\n#C236196003Saber#CDEF!? Listen―to what―I'm saying!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "745904"
msgid "Don't go reminiscing!\nHey! I said I'm not a virgin!\nI have TOO much experience!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "746084"
msgid "W-why is THAT the one thing you have\nto feel sorry for me for!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "746248"
msgid "Ahh! Ahh! Ahh!\nSHUT! UP!\nSHUT! UP! THIS! INSTANT!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "746312"
msgid "Ugh. Please settle down…!\nAt this rate, her voice will end up crashing me\nbefore I even get melted down!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "746612"
msgid "#C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF took off.\nUm, in the end…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "746764"
msgid "Please continue forward.\n…well done, #C236196003Saber#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "746836"
msgid "This is good timing, Master.\nHow does blowing her last secret\nwide open sound?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "746920"
msgid "Her last secret?\n…her third #C000246204SG#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "747132"
msgid "…seriously? You really don't know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "747440"
msgid "Yeah, yeah. And?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "747572"
msgid "Okay, okay. And?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "747964"
msgid "Ah, well, you see…! Damn.\nIt's hard to explain this since you're…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "748136"
msgid "#C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF. Before we clash,\nI have something to ask you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "748624"
msgid "Now! Go, Master!!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "748948"
msgid "Ah… ahh…! You per-per-per――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "748984"
msgid "You PERVERT!!\nPolice! Help!\nThere's some macho pervert here!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "749580"
msgid "Masteeer――!!!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "749612"
msgid "Umm, I'm sorry to interrupt.\n#C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF is heading for where my brain is.\nIf we fail here…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "749732"
msgid "Oh, yeah. I seldom get a turn at teasing #C236196003Archer#CDEF,\nso I got caught up in it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "749932"
msgid "Darling, Darling!\nMy ears just tingled.\nI may know what her secret is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "750116"
msgid "Yes鷙 So please entrust this to me.\nPlease wait a moment at the starting line\nand be ready to dash."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "750584"
msgid "You've realized it too late. #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF.\nYou have yet to experience love from\na gentleman, no?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "750736"
msgid "Wha――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "750940"
msgid "Wh―sto―wait, wait a second!\nMe, a virgin!? AS IF!!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "751336"
msgid "Who do you think I am!?\nI'm #C236196003Elizabeth Báthory#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "751408"
msgid "A sexy bombshell renowned for being a lewd\nand loose madam!\nE-experience? I have tons!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "751572"
msgid "―――!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "751584"
msgid "Also, stuff like *humuna humuna*,\nand stuff like *WAMMM*!\nYou've had plenty of those, righttt?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "751680"
msgid "W-w-w-w-w-wha…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "751772"
msgid "…I empathize.\nIt took everything I had not to run off\nafter hearing those lines coming out of #C236196003Caster#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "752664"
msgid "Kya☆ All of that was just plain fiction,\nof course鷙 I'm devoted to Darling鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "752780"
msgid "…#C236196003Caster#CDEF. …she's one scary Servant…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "753184"
msgid "Her third #C000246204SG#CDEF…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "753500"
msgid "W-what is it, #C236196003Gorgeous#CDEF?\nThinking about it now, you've been\noddly quiet since you entered…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "753716"
msgid "#[Piggy][Squirrely]# is the one I want to tease.\nNo one asked for you. I'll let you leave,\nso hurry up and beat it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "753952"
msgid "Wha―――No way―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "754444"
msgid "Bwha――!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "754464"
msgid "What the――――――!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "754492"
msgid "Did this guy turn into a Berserker, TOO!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "754552"
msgid "Kya―――kyaaaaaaaa!\nPervert! Pervert! Pervert!\nWhy are you getting naked in public!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "754764"
msgid "―――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "754776"
msgid "―――Eh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "754788"
msgid "V-virgin? #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "755136"
msgid "Stu-stu-stu―are you STUPID!?\nWho are you calling a virgin!?\nAs if I would be so lame―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "755384"
msgid "Awah! Awawawah!\nAwawawawawawah!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "755720"
msgid "#C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF is so shocked,\nsteam bellows from her flushed face."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "755940"
msgid "Go-go―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "756392"
msgid "………listen.\nMr. #C236196003King of Heroes#CDEF can really act dumb\nsometimes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "756664"
msgid "…#C236196003Rani#CDEF is right."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "757648"
msgid "Good.\nHe looks fine, not a scratch on him."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "757696"
msgid "…what happened to her?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "757820"
msgid "Hmph…………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "758044"
msgid "What is it?\nLet's hurry and get out.\nThe cleanup is about to kick in―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "758196"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF……!!!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "758260"
msgid "*kgh*! Not the best timing…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "758348"
msgid "――――――."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "758444"
msgid "If #C236196003White Sakura#CDEF is cleansed,\nI'll simply disappear."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "758520"
msgid "This #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF is a clone… or rather,\nthe body of someone infected by her virus\nand made to look like her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "758872"
msgid "…what are you up to?\nWas it not enough for you to send #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF\nand me here?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "760548"
msgid "Wha…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "760560"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF giggles."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "760744"
msgid "But, Senpai!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "760764"
msgid "It's my win. Be quiet, hypocrite.\nNow, let me propose this again:\ncease defying me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "761560"
msgid "I'll melt down everything in this world.\nNot #C236196003BB#CDEF. I will.\nSo―――don't hurt my feelings."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "762176"
msgid "So come with me, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF.\nOnly I can protect you.\nWe'll have the last laugh―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "762268"
msgid "So come with me, #C236196003Archer#CDEF.\nOnly I can protect you.\nWe'll have the last laugh―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "763520"
msgid "O-ohh……\nY…… yeah, well,\nI knew that stuff already!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "764884"
msgid "Ahh, man. #C236196003Jinako#CDEF turned out to be hopeless."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "764976"
msgid "Since we've competed over the net,\nI expected her to be no ordinary player.\nBut look! She's just a damn NEET!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "765184"
msgid "Huh…? Back already, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "765244"
msgid "#C236196003Rani#CDEF's Labyrinth is tougher than #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF's?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "765380"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF…? Nah, no relation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "766372"
msgid "…hmph. I hate to say it, but #C236196003Rani#CDEF won.\nI AM a gamer.\nWe accept it when we lose in the game."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "766736"
msgid "Good. Since I'M the one\nwho's going to beat her at chess, see?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "766904"
msgid "Eh? The chess games are over?\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF went into the Relief?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "766984"
msgid "Wh-what's going on!?\nJust who beat her in chess!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "767236"
msgid "Ahh, my head is still spinning…\nWhy was only MY camera spinning around\nand around!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "767512"
msgid "#C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF still had human weaknesses,\nbut those #C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF,\nerr, they're no joke, you know…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "769060"
msgid "Heh. I was worried for a second there,\nbut #C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF are no big deal.\nEven you could take 'em on, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "769396"
msgid "Huh? It's an #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF?\nYou've been going up against THAT!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "769472"
msgid "Catching an #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF, huh?\n…well, I won't be doing anything about it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "770324"
msgid "#C236196003J#CDEF-#C236196003Jinako#CDEF is missing?\nWhat did you do, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "770424"
msgid "You left her alone there and came back\non your own? Did you just up and run away…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "770520"
msgid "N-no… That can't be it.\n…sorry, my bad.\nNo point in blaming you, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "771084"
msgid "………! #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF!\nYou, if it weren't for you…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "771148"
msgid "…no, that's not it.\nThat's not it…! DAMN IT!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "771208"
msgid "Shut up! Don't talk to me!\nLeave me alone!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "771528"
msgid "……so #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's the Sentinel this time around…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "771616"
msgid "So this was how she felt, huh?\nI… get how she feels now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "771688"
msgid "Ultimately, #C236196003Jinako#CDEF had no place to go back to."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "771848"
msgid "So, #C236196003Gatou#CDEF faced off against #C236196003Jinako#CDEF, huh?\nI had to face…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "772028"
msgid "Come on, leave me alone!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "772072"
msgid "#C236196003Gatou#CDEF… is dead…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "772116"
msgid "Haha… hahahahahaha…\nThat dumbass…\nAnd he even had a tiny shred of hope left…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "772548"
msgid "So how about we just surrender to #C236196003BB#CDEF?\nSooner rather than later.\nShe'll spare us, won't she?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "772984"
msgid "…oh, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nHaha, you must think I'm a hopeless case,\ntoo, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "773236"
msgid "Sympathy is only going to make me\nmore miserable! #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF, you――\nevery one of you is looking down on me…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "773508"
msgid "……what, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF?\nIs there something on my face?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "773632"
msgid "You got somethin' you need to do\nover there, too? Then don't worry about me\nand get to it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "774136"
msgid "What is it? I'm about to leave."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "775136"
msgid "Could it really be that she thinks\nshe \"has no more secrets\"?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "775928"
msgid "But, no program is perfect. Even if each\nindividual part is perfect, when two parts\ncollide, the reaction can breed flaws."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "776128"
msgid "If you can agitate, or even make #C236196003Rani#CDEF excited,\nyou might be able to get a glimpse of her #C000246204SG#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "776256"
msgid "…the hell are you―― Don't talk to me!\nUnlike you, I'm busy, see?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "776656"
msgid "Did you know? Conflict only breaks out\nbetween those of equal levels.\nKid bait only baits kids."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "776764"
msgid "Thaaat aside…\nWhy do you know about Darling's problems?\nDid you eavesdrop in so-me-whe-re, hmmm?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "777552"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF doesn't know much about real,\ninterpersonal relationships. Do you, #C236196003Karna#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "778244"
msgid "#C236196003Rani#CDEF's final secret… Hmm.\nIt's difficult to say, since I've never met\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF… What's your take, #C236196003Andersen#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "778876"
msgid "…are you serious? A harpy like you should\nbe able to smell a fragrant girl's pretension\nall the way from the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "779136"
msgid "…I don't understand what you mean, but…\nhave you completely figured out #C236196003Rani#CDEF's secret?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "779244"
msgid "Yes. Thus, I can't give advice. Giving a girl's\nsecret to outsiders is the height of stupidity.\nLike praising flowers while you pluck them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "779520"
msgid "Or what, #C236196003Kiara#CDEF?\nAre you telling me to become an honest writer,\nputting the plain truth down with my pen?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "779652"
msgid "…*sigh*. You really are a pain to deal with.\nI apologize, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nPlease seek help from someone else."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "779968"
msgid "Heh…\nLooks like you need my help, eh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "780308"
msgid "Hmm. Let's take a break in My Room for now,\nDarling～"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "780372"
msgid "#C236196003Tamamo#CDEF's brain is wiped out from\nthinking too much. Let's have ourselves\nsomething sugary, real sugary鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "781760"
msgid "Ehhh. #C236196003Shinji#CDEF, beating THAT human computer?\n…maybe I shouldn't say so.\nHe seems pretty determined."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "781892"
msgid "Divinations sometimes come true, and sometimes\ndon't. Anyway, we won't know unless we try.\n\"Kelp,\" was your name, yes?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "782320"
msgid "King? Well, sure I guess. I AM the Game Champ.\nI practically sweat auras!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "782488"
msgid "Dang, he looks so cool…\nAh, uh, not that he could beat my #C236196003Rider#CDEF!\n…as long as she's not hammered."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "787788"
msgid "Yeah, I was chosen…\nThere's no way I'd lose in the 1st Round――\nHuh? O-Oh, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

