#. unk_op1659
msgctxt "811712"
msgid "　You cannot carry any more\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF."
msgstr "　Você não pode carregar mais\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF."

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "811768"
msgid "After making a shortcut to the old school from\nthe #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF, please return to base."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "811872"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, you appear to have accumulated\na lot of fatigue. I recommend that\nyou return for the moment to take a rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "812008"
msgid "I'm concerned about #C236196003Rin#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "812052"
msgid "Searching the Labyrinth is nice and all,\nbut I should #C000246204return to the old school#CDEF to\nbriefly speak with #C236196003Kiara#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "812192"
msgid "I obtained the first #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nLet's briefly return to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and sort\nout the situation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "812312"
msgid "First thing to do is activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF.\nThat'll help move our search along."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "812412"
msgid "We took more damage from our fight with #C236196003Lancer#CDEF\nthan I expected. Now would be a good time to head\nback to the old school.\nLuckily, there's a #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF near us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "812604"
msgid "What's wrong, Praetor?\nLet's #C000246204continue onward#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "812668"
msgid "Don't worry. I'll protect you, Darling.\nSo, continue on #C000246204ahead#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "812748"
msgid "Surely you're not telling me that you're\nfrightened? Even you understand that stopping\nhere is impermissible, yes?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "812864"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. After you activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF,\nplease have yourself a rest in your\nprivate room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "812992"
msgid "Even in cyberspace, you need proper rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "813036"
msgid "Once you activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF,\nuse it to get back here.\nI'll bet you're exhausted, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "813164"
msgid "#[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF, return to base for now.\nLet's discuss our plan\nin the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "813292"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, please come back.\nYou've accumulated a lot of fatigue;\nany more will be dangerous!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "813400"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF's worried state gets across to\nme even over the transmission."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "813488"
msgid "She's right, it would be best if\nwe returned to the #C000246204Old School Building#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "813580"
msgid "We obtained the #C000246204SG#CDEF. Let's return to the\n#C000246204Old School Building#CDEF for the time being.\nWe can come again after we recover."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "813728"
msgid "We got the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nMission complete.\nLet's head home and get some rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "813812"
msgid "Where are you going? We secured the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nThere's nothing urgent to tend to.\nBack to #C000246204My Room#CDEF, now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "813944"
msgid "Hrrrm? Where are you going, #C236196003#FAMILY\n#GIVEN#CDEF? Where are you going,\nleaving me behind?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "814044"
msgid "For a second there, I was thinking about\nleaving #C236196003Gatou#CDEF and heading back,\nbut it probably won't rest easy on my conscience,\nso let's turn back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "814204"
msgid "Wait, Praetor. If we're going to head back,\nit'll behoove us for the future to have\nthe #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF activated."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "814332"
msgid "Master, let's look for the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF.\nIt should be around here somewhere…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "814424"
msgid "We don't need to walk all the way back.\nWe can use the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF to reach the\nold school in a flash. Very nifty."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "814556"
msgid "M-my stomach is at its limit…\nI want to hurry back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and get some rest…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "814656"
msgid "Before we go to the next floor,\nlet's #C000246204head back to the Student Council Room#CDEF.\nWe need to hand over the data we got from #C236196003Green Archer#CDEF.\nHe gave his life to entrust us with it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "814864"
msgid "Huh? You're still in the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF?\nCome on, there's nothing to do there.\nGet your butt back here!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "814988"
msgid "We'll talk about what comes next tomorrow,\nso #C000246204come back and get some rest#CDEF.\nAfter, drop by the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "815120"
msgid "We're in a race against time.\nWe need to hurry to the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "815212"
msgid "I can't let #C236196003Shinji#CDEF's hopes go to waste.\nLet's press on so we can catch up to #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "815336"
msgid "Praetor, I've grown tired. Let us return\nto My Room and have ourselves a bath."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "815416"
msgid "I know how you feel, but knowing\nwhen to rest is also part of the battle.\nLet's head back to My Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "815520"
msgid "Darling, now is the time for rest.\nLet's return to our room and\nrecover our strength."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "815608"
msgid "What an impatient #[man][woman]#. Laboring away\nis not all there is to life, you know?\nWhen it's time to rest, rest."
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "815728"
msgid "You may now save your current game data\n            as #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."
msgstr "Agora você pode salvar seus dados\n         como #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "815812"
msgid "     You may use this data to carry\nover elements to the start of a new game."
msgstr "     Você pode usar esses dados para levar\nelementos ao início de um novo jogo."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "815892"
msgid "Please be careful to not overwrite\n  the data while you are saving."
msgstr "Tome cuidado para não sobrescrever\n  os dados ao salvar."

#. unk_op1653
msgctxt "815960"
msgid "Would you like to save your Clear Data?"
msgstr "Deseja salvar seus Clear Data?"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line1
msgctxt "816000"
msgid "Are you sure you wish to exit"
msgstr "Tem certeza de que deseja sair"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line2
msgctxt "816032"
msgid "without saving the Clear Data?"
msgstr "sem salvar os Clear Data?"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "816064"
msgid "It's already activated."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "816088"
msgid "No need to press this again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "816120"
msgid "…we emerge into an odd space.\nA cluster of gates stand before us.\nThere must be some meaning behind them…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "816228"
msgid "Kya! That was close!\nMy tail almost got lopped off!\nWho did this!? Show yourself!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "816312"
msgid "There are traps inside this body…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "816348"
msgid "A barrier came down on the passage we had entered from.\nLooks like we're completely sealed in."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "816444"
msgid "…but this is the inside of #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's digital frame.\nIt's strange for there to be a setup like this inside her…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "816572"
msgid "You came into the cage yourself?\nNow THAT'S one worthy rival. You couldn't wait\nany longer for our match, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "816688"
msgid "…there's more to sweets than just piling on\nsugar. Still, pointing out this Servant's\nmistakes won't do us any good."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "816808"
msgid "Oh, boy… If she had just laid back\nand sat on her throne as bosses do,\nshe could've maintained her dignity."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "816920"
msgid "But she bothered to come all this way and\nshow us what a rock-for-brains she is.\nIt's so appalling it's pathetic."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "817036"
msgid "Alright. Time to rip off that tail.\nThere's only room for one pretty-tailed\nlady around here―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "817136"
msgid "―――Hey, #C236196003lizard woman#CDEF.\nWhen did you class change\nout of being a Lancer?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "817228"
msgid "…as I thought.\nI've been wondering for a while now.\nYou're no longer a Lancer, are you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "817320"
msgid "You've got a sharp eye.\nI got tired of being a Lancer, so I changed.\nSee, don't I look like an idol?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "817424"
msgid "I never knew this was possible…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "817460"
msgid "Hee hee. You want to know? Yes, of course.\nWhy wouldn't you want to know?\n…but I won't tell you for free."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "817568"
msgid "This puzzle is my challenge for you. If you want\nto know my secret, then flip these doors and\nget over to where I am."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "817688"
msgid "Hee hee. I had tons of time to kill,\nso I got to work on building this all up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "817768"
msgid "P-please don't go tinkering with people's\nbodies at your whimsy! Put everything back\nwhere you found it after this… okay?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "817892"
msgid "I'll be getting back to my hijacking business\nnow. I'm sure this will be too hard for\n#[piggy][squirrely]#―meaning it's game over!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "818024"
msgid "…I suppose those are the doors.\nGo on, give it a try, Praetor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "818088"
msgid "This… is a simple puzzle.\nIt'll be easy to solve once you\nunderstand the rules."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "818172"
msgid "A puzzle… If I mess this up,\nthat will mean I've got less brains\nthan that woman…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "818256"
msgid "This is truly foolish. The rules will make\nsense once you make a few small trials.\nFinish this up quickly."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "818364"
msgid "There are three types of #C000246204doors#CDEF and #C000246204switches#CDEF:"
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line2
msgctxt "818444"
msgid "will open two blue doors."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "818472"
msgid "Pressing a #C000246204yellow#CDEF switch"
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line2
msgctxt "818516"
msgid "will open one yellow door."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "818544"
msgid "However, when that door opens,"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "818576"
msgid "No way! You figured it out!?\nWell… the first one is always pretty easy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "818652"
msgid "#C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF's voice echoes―from where, I can't tell."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "818720"
msgid "I solved the puzzle, so I want her to keep to her\npromise and tell us what her class is now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "818816"
msgid "Guess I have to. Listen and be amazed.\nPreviously, I was a singing, stabbing,\nlance-wielding idol―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "818920"
msgid "But what of the curse of Mad Enhancement?\nI thought Berserkers were always burdened\nwith it…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "819016"
msgid "But what happened to the Mad Enhancement status?\nDon't tell me you only turned a little savage…\nI'm sure that's not the case."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "819144"
msgid "Wrong! You're obviously all brawn, no brain!\nDoes that make you a macho idol?\nWhere in the world is THAT popular?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "819260"
msgid "That singing voice of yours is EXACTLY like\na Berserker's yell, yeah!\n\"Gwaah,\" \"Gwaaaaah.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "819352"
msgid "A Berserker renowned for making people into\ntumbling dolls of flesh. Of all the things…\nHer depravity has plummeted to new lows."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "819484"
msgid "But why do you still have a hold on your sanity?\nYou should've lost your ability to reason\nif you're a Berserker."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "819600"
msgid "Hmph. I'm special.\nWould you mind not lumping me together\nwith other Berserkers?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "819684"
msgid "I'm under Mad Enhancement, alright.\nCompletely under it, actually.\nBut I won't be letting go of my self."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "819792"
msgid "After all, I've been crazy from the very start!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "819840"
msgid "Hm, hm. Looks like I impressed you so much that\nyou have no words. Now, come after me.\nI'll keep playing around with you!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "819964"
msgid "This next puzzle is unbeatable.\nIt's so hard that even I can't solve it without\npure luck. Enjoy suffering through it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "820084"
msgid "It's #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF again.\n…I'm glad that every moment she spends messing\nwith us delays her assimilation with #C236196003Sakura#CDEF, but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "820240"
msgid "It gets a little old, really."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "820272"
msgid "Hee hee. Looks like you're racking your brain.\nI know, I know.\nThese kinds of puzzles get frustrating."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "820376"
msgid "Alrighty.\nYou made it this far,\nso I may as well chat with you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "820440"
msgid "My noble self shall ask of you a question,\nso be grateful as a fan should be and answer it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "820532"
msgid "Remember how I mentioned before that this body\nis good enough to become me?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "820608"
msgid "The first requirement is to have a pretty face.\nNext is to be young. Lastly is to be\ninexperienced―――to be chaste!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "820728"
msgid "Stop fidgeting, Master.\nRelax. Relax, I said… Don't react,\nor we won't hear the end of it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "820820"
msgid "Why is everyone in #C236196003BB#CDEF's faction like this?\nAlways so sure of themselves…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "820912"
msgid "Hmph. That's quite a standard you claim to have.\nYou can say it loud again if you feel the\nneed to."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "821012"
msgid "Now I'll ask you a question, #[piggy][squirrely]#:\n\"One should be chaste until marriage―but up\nuntil what age?\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "821128"
msgid "What do you think?\nTell me your opinion."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "821172"
msgid "Until you're thirty."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "821196"
msgid "Until you're twenty."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "821220"
msgid "But I wonder if you can solve this puzzle?\nWith your simple mind, there's no way you'll\nsolve it no matter how long you take!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "821348"
msgid "So everything is fine. Yep, all fine. I won't\npay you any mind. I'll just go back and repaint\nmy nails or something!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "821468"
msgid "In modern society――especially developed countries,\nthe number of people who fuss over that sort of thing\nare decreasing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "821592"
msgid "I answer,\n\"Actually, those who say one should stay chaste forever\n if need be, are in the minority.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "821696"
msgid "Agh, enough! My head feels like it's going\nto explode! I'm going to head back and\neat some sweets!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "821796"
msgid "She was being candid about her true opinions.\nIs it because she became a Berserker?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "821880"
msgid "…it seems like Mad Enhancement IS affecting\nher, somewhat. I get the feeling she's become\neven worse than before."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "821996"
msgid "What's the deal with that lizard!?\nShe's a total riot!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "822052"
msgid "Hee, hee hee, hee hee hee hee hee…!\nNow I've got a joke worth teasing her with…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "822136"
msgid "A Berserker's Mad Enhancement skill making one\nmore candid? That's a new one. This means her\nnormal self is much harder for her to bear."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "822276"
msgid "…in any case, #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF left.\nLet's get this puzzle over with and keep going."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "822372"
msgid "Mhm. My #RUBS  Master#RUBEPraetor#REND does it again.\nLooks like you solved this one handily."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "822468"
msgid "Now, let's go towards the end.\nApparently, there's something I need to ask\nmy rival now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "822560"
msgid "Cleared it.\nI was iffy about it initially, but this level of\ndifficulty is no problem."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "822648"
msgid "Now, let's keep going. Looks like we have\nsomething to gain from this exploration apart\nfrom rescuing #C236196003Sakura#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "822776"
msgid "And that's a wrap♪ Now, let's have ourselves\nan easy chase after that horn-girl―\nthen have ourselves a reaaaaaaaall fun time鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "822908"
msgid "Obviously you would solve some figure-matching\nof this level. Let's make haste. Spiritron world\nor no, I won't allow a Servant to incarnate."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "823052"
msgid "She sliced up my data as small as it would go,\nthen tossed it away.\nMixed me right into the virus."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "823152"
msgid "My contract with #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF was voided,\nand I have no way of getting out…\nThis may as well be a death sentence."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "823280"
msgid "Normally, he wouldn't accept this disgraceful state, though.\nMaybe he's suffering from the despair of being abandoned."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "823400"
msgid "At any rate, I'm glad he's alright.\nI try asking if #C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF can send #C236196003Shinji#CDEF\nback to the school."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "823552"
msgid "*sigh* …out of curiosity, what are we supposed\nto do with him after we send him back?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "823640"
msgid "He might not be #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF's Master anymore,\nbut that doesn't change the fact that\nhe's a traitor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "823756"
msgid "Sure, maybe that's the case here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "823792"
msgid "But… he looks just like HIM,\nthe one who stood by our side in that perilous fight――\nThe unarmed Shinji-boy――!!!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "823912"
msgid "Hold on! I'M the one that thing was based on!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "823960"
msgid "Well, I figured you would say something like\nthat. I have plenty of mind to give to\n#C236196003Shinji#CDEF, but I'll let it rest for now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "824100"
msgid "I'll transmit the entrance's coordinates. #C236196003Shinji\nMatou#CDEF, you be on standby there. #[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF,\nplease continue with expelling the virus."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "824276"
msgid "Returning to the entrance means…\nBut #C236196003Shinji#CDEF has no Servant.\nI wonder if he can make it alone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "824388"
msgid "…of course I can make it.\nWho do you think I am? If there's an exit,\nI can make it there on my own."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "824492"
msgid "…besides, all this concern makes\nme more miserable than I need to be.\nPick up what I'm putting down, will ya…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "824604"
msgid "This next puzzle is godly.\nEven I can't solve it.\nSomeone of your skill shouldn't be able to."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "824700"
msgid "Okay, show me how you suffer.\nI feel bad for you being all locked in,\nso I'll wait here and watch you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "824804"
msgid "No way―――are you ACTUALLY a genius!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "824844"
msgid "What is this…? I took so much care in making\nthis so that you would live until the very,\nvery end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "824944"
msgid "If only you had stayed trapped,\nyou would've melted away without pain.\nA gentle death…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "825032"
msgid "Judging by #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF's reaction,\nthis was apparently the last puzzle."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "825120"
msgid "\"Give up and leave #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's body―――\"\nThe moment I take a step forward and assert this,\n#C236196003Saber#CDEF suddenly tugs at my sleeve."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "825276"
msgid "\"Give up and leave #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's body―――\"\nThe moment I take a step forward and assert this,\n#C236196003Archer#CDEF suddenly taps my shoulder."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "825432"
msgid "\"Give up and leave #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's body―――\"\nThe moment I take a step forward and assert this,\n#C236196003Caster#CDEF suddenly whispers in my ear."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "825592"
msgid "\"Give up and leave #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's body―――\"\nThe moment I take a step forward and assert this,\n#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF suddenly calls out for me to stop."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "825760"
msgid "Praetor, how about you let me take it\nfrom here? I have an idea of what her secret is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "825848"
msgid "#C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF's third secret?\nThe one we weren't able to obtain\nin the Labyrinth…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "825948"
msgid "My rival. For a long time now, I've been\nconsidering something. I became sure of it just\nnow. May I ask you about it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "826068"
msgid "What? Is a singer of your caliber begging for\nher life? Now? Do you want to know how your\ndeath will go down?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "826180"
msgid "Mhm, perhaps I do. I've been so curious\nthat not asking about it has dulled my blade.\nI cannot fight at all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "826292"
msgid "I see. Fine. Our fierce contests as resplendent\nsingers have put us on good terms.\nI'll answer, why not?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "826400"
msgid "I'm grateful. So, without further ado――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "826444"
msgid "#C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF goes bright red up to her ears."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "826504"
msgid "Wh-whaaat!?\nSo basically, her last secret is…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "826552"
msgid "I got it. I actually got it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "826584"
msgid "Out of huge shock, #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF stands dead still,\nmouth flapping open and closed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "826680"
msgid "It looks like she's not an #ROFS0002#RUBS    Ego #RUBEoffshoot#REND―\nthere are no signs of her body deteriorating."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "826796"
msgid "――――She probably wishes she would shrink\naway and disappear right about now, though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "826888"
msgid "Looking back, I once also sought to look older.\nI thought I would be an adult if I spoke of\ndirty things, used foul words―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "827016"
msgid "But I also pity you, and it pains me.\nThat's because I'm not in a position\nto share my Master with you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "827120"
msgid "I don't feel sorry for you. Rather, it's a\nshame. Dragon girl, so innocent―I look closely\nupon your tail and how adorable it is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "827252"
msgid "Hrm. Okay. Sorry about that. Then let's agree\nto leave the matter pending.\nThough the outcome is clear enough."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "827364"
msgid "D-damned sex-crazed emperor…!\nI-I'll get you for this! I'm super strong!\nI'll tear you limb from limb soon enough!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "827480"
msgid "Beyond here is the core of her body――\nThe part where her brain lies.\nSeems like you can finish this there."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "827592"
msgid "But we don't have any clues yet.\nAnd #C000246204Five Meditations#CDEF isn't reacting, either―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "827692"
msgid "Hey, c'mon… If you look at how she's acting\nnow, and recall what she stated before,\nyou should figure it out in a snap."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "827816"
msgid "Unfortunately, no…\nI don't seem to possess the same level of\ninsight that #C236196003Archer#CDEF does."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "827920"
msgid "If he does know, I want him to explain it to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "827972"
msgid "\"Explain it\"…\nWell, I guess you can't make an\nomelette without breaking a few eggs…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "828060"
msgid "Let's start with her first #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nWe gathered that she dreams of a love gushing\nwith romance, as young ladies do."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "828188"
msgid "Next, the second: her desire to be a beloved\nwife who loves to cook… but looking at her\nwork, we know she doesn't practice regularly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "828324"
msgid "Lastly, her statement before was conclusive.\nWhat did say about what she wants from a woman\nwhose body she'll take for her own?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "828452"
msgid "If I recall correctly――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "828480"
msgid "She must have a pretty face.\nShe must be young.\nFinally, she must be chaste… I think that's what she said."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "828588"
msgid "――――something about that is conclusive?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "828632"
msgid "Dude… You're supposed to be a male\nin high school…?\nWell, that IS just an avatar…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "828720"
msgid "I get it. Nevermind. I'll identify what it is.\nYou just get ready to extract her #C000246204SG#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "828824"
msgid "I get it. Nevermind. I'll identify what it is.\nIn exchange, DO NOT make a big deal and call\nthis sexual harassment or something later."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "828960"
msgid "Oh? I wonder what it could be.\nIf it's about my concert schedule,\nI'd prefer if you ask my manager."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "829060"
msgid "It's nothing major like that.\nIt's about the staff member you recruited."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "829136"
msgid "She must have a pretty face. Be young.\nLastly, be chaste. Those were the\nrequirements, right? However―― ahem."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "829248"
msgid "YOU'RE the one who has no experience!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "829288"
msgid "#C236196003Archer#CDEF points straight at #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF.\nShe stiffens up, as if she had been shot…\nand quickly flushes red up to her ears."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "829440"
msgid "W-wha… what are you saying all of a sudden!!??"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "829488"
msgid "I got it. I actually got it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "829520"
msgid "Out of huge shock, #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF stands dead still,\nmouth flapping open and closed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "829616"
msgid "It looks like she's not an #ROFS0002#RUBS    Ego #RUBEoffshoot#REND―\nthere are no signs of her body deteriorating."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "829732"
msgid "――――She probably wishes she would shrink\naway and disappear right about now, though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "829824"
msgid "He caught a helpless idol and suddenly pointed\nhis finger at her―he's asking if she's a\nvirgin! I'm scared! Save me, father!!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "829952"
msgid "Wha-!? Who're you calling a pervert!?\nI have to do this to reveal your secret…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "830036"
msgid "Oof. That really left a bad impression.\nI'm disgusted, too. No, no. We can't have this.\nYou're out, no more strikes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "830156"
msgid "It's been fully recorded. Let's nominate this\nfor \"gentleman's film of the year\" and offer\nit at #C236196003President Leo#CDEF's grave."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "830292"
msgid "Hey, hold up. Why does that need to happen?\nWhy is no one taking my side!\nMaster, say something―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "830396"
msgid "I won't forget your sacrifice."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "830428"
msgid "――――I'm sleeping in a different room from now on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "830484"
msgid "We need to focus on saving #C236196003Sakura#CDEF.\nLet's go after #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF and press on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "830592"
msgid "Wow. #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF's third secret?\nThe one we weren't able to obtain in the Labyrinth…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "830696"
msgid "Hehehe… #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF.\nI have a small question for you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "830768"
msgid "I have no interest in talking to a fox.\nAre you begging for her life? Now? Do you want\nto know how your death will go down?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "830892"
msgid "Yes, to perish in agony from the embarrassment…\nI wish to see such a spectacle.\n―――But for you, not me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "831000"
msgid "W-what's your deal? That smile is pure evil.\nAre you really just a Heroic Spirit?\nCould you be one of those, more than me…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "831128"
msgid "So, like, you're a virgin, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "831164"
msgid "#C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF goes bright red up to her ears."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "831224"
msgid "Wh-whaaat!?\nSo basically, her last secret is…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "831272"
msgid "Yep, bingo! You can't talk your way\nout of this one!\nDarling, please go straight at her!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "831364"
msgid "I got it. I actually got it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "831396"
msgid "Out of huge shock, #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF stands dead still,\nmouth flapping open and closed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "831492"
msgid "It looks like she's not an #ROFS0002#RUBS    Ego #RUBEoffshoot#REND―\nthere are no signs of her body deteriorating."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "831608"
msgid "――――She probably wishes she would shrink\naway and disappear right about now, though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "831700"
msgid "Wha… wh-wh-wha… What are you talking about!?\nI don't understand at all!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "831776"
msgid "Ohoo? Then you done stuff like *hrmm hrmm*,\nand stuff like *hmmm hmmm*…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "831852"
msgid "#C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF breaks off mid sentence,\nface flushing red like a flame."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "831936"
msgid "Hee hee hee. Now it's your turn.\nWill you share with me tales of your own valor?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "832020"
msgid "Ah―uwaaah, awawawawah….\nA-a-as if―――as if I could do something\nlike that, you dummy!!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "832112"
msgid "I mean, I didn't even understand half of that!\nWhich country's greater fairy of lust are you\nbased from!? Are you really a Heroic Spirit!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "832252"
msgid "This is information I would also like to know."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "832300"
msgid "I probably knew before I fell to the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "832376"
msgid "*kgh*… I'll get you for this!\nI-I'll be like that one day, too!\nI'll give you your credit, THIS time!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "832480"
msgid "Hmph. Finally realized it? All she did was wring\nout some maidens within her area. Petty crimes\nlike that are nothing to gloat over."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "832616"
msgid "I'm a great fairy who brought five dynasties\nto ruin.\nPlease go pick on someone your own size."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "832712"
msgid "Umm, #C236196003Caster#CDEF…!\nMay we end the embarrassing discussion\nhere, please…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "832800"
msgid "I'm linked to the both of you…\nSo I received visuals on what just happened…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "832880"
msgid "Pressing further on the matter would be dangerous.\nIt'll just come back to bite me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "832964"
msgid "…let's collect ourselves, clear our heads of this\nblood that rushed up, and go after #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "833080"
msgid "Now, now. Wait, Master.\nI entrusted you with the figure-matching.\nLet me discipline this degenerate dragon."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "833188"
msgid "I think you've already known what it is for some\ntime now, but how about we reveal her\nthird #C000246204SG#CDEF, at last?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "833312"
msgid "A-actually, I have no idea what it is,\nand #C000246204Five Meditations#CDEF isn't reacting―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "833412"
msgid "Hahahaha. You would be so bold as to feign\nignorance? You're quite rotten to the core,\nas well."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "833508"
msgid "But I won't entrust this to you. The king is the\none capable of plucking seductive melodies\nout of miserable girls."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "833624"
msgid "Occasionally, even I act without restraint.\nYou sit there and witness the king's influence."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "833716"
msgid "Y-your eyes are nasty, as usual. You're a snake.\nAnd those snake eyes embody everything a\nman is―cruel; ruthless; no delicacy!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "833844"
msgid "Heh. I'm not that cruel. Innocent dragon girl,\ndon't be so cold to me. Also, I'm sorry.\nFor being so dense up until now, I apologize."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "833980"
msgid "H-he actually gave an apology!\nIt was just a small one, but the #C236196003King of Heroes#CDEF\nlowered his chin and quietly expressed regret…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "834128"
msgid "Wait, why are you apologizing?\nI don't recall you doing anyth―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "834196"
msgid "No. I apologized for being insensitive\nto the little things, which a proper\nman must not do."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "834292"
msgid "Is it not so, chaste dragon? For some time now,\nyou've been making firm appeals to me.\nBut I continued to ignore you. I'm sorry."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "834424"
msgid "Take this apology from me, at the very least.\nHere I go――#RUBS       A U O   #RUBE#C236196003King of Heroes#CDEF#REND Cast Off!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "834556"
msgid "Your embarrassment comes as no surprise.\nMy naked body surpasses the highest cut of\ndiamond. Even more so to virgin eyes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "834680"
msgid "But I excuse you for your chastity. You may\ncome closer, it's fine. How about I bestow\nyou with a king's affection?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "834796"
msgid "Stu-stu-stu-stu-stu―――\ns-stu-stu-stu―――\nstu-stu-stu-stu-stu-stu-stu-stu…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "834880"
msgid "#C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF's entire body is awash with embarrassment.\nIt's probably turning bright red out of anger."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "834996"
msgid "I don't want to believe it… but basically,\nher final #C000246204SG#CDEF is―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "835080"
msgid "Then approach me. If you're familiar with this,\nthen gaze more intently. Or not. It matters not."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "835180"
msgid "The naked king quickly takes a captivating pose."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "835232"
msgid "It's extremely effective."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "835260"
msgid "Now, dash, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF!\nHaha! This is no time to be enthralled with me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "835344"
msgid "While objecting with all my might that\nthat wasn't the case, I run to #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "835444"
msgid "Sorry, #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF… I'm really sorry.\nI'm really sorry for bringing a Servant like this\nalong with me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "835564"
msgid "I got it. I actually got it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "835596"
msgid "It looks like she's not an #ROFS0002#RUBS    Ego #RUBEoffshoot#REND―\nthere are no signs of her body deteriorating."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "835712"
msgid "――――She probably wishes she would shrink\naway and disappear right about now, though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "835804"
msgid "You're a Gorgeous PERVERT!\nSave me, father! \nthe naked barbarians are hunting me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "835888"
msgid "…hm. That didn't go as expected. Degenerate\ndragon. I was certain she was mesmerized by my\ninfluence and was about to submit to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "836024"
msgid "But there's nothing that can be done about it.\nIt must be because I'm far too handsome."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "836112"
msgid "In her own way, she is one who seeks beauty.\nI suppose she trembled in fear after coming\nto know the difference in our quality."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "836240"
msgid "………………\nI'll let that slide without commenting on it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "836300"
msgid "If I were to make an unnecessary remark about the matter,\nI don't know what kind of snake I might stir up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "836408"
msgid "There's a fine line between geniuses and idiots,\nright? We've decided to delete the previous\nfive minutes of recording."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "836528"
msgid "#C236196003President #FAMILY#CDEF, please refrain\nfrom bringing that topic back up again\nand focus on removing the virus."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "836652"
msgid "Whether he \"cast off\" in order to mock #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF\nor if he was serious, let's bury the matter away―deep."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "836776"
msgid "We need to focus on rescuing #C236196003Sakura#CDEF right now."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd
msgctxt "836840"
msgid "Return to the Student Council Room?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "836876"
msgid "Return to the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "836912"
msgid "#C236196003Shinji#CDEF is waiting by the entrance."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "836964"
msgid "\"Her\"――I tell him… If it's #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF he's referring to,\nshe's been sealed away in a prison she'll never escape from."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "837100"
msgid "Albeit for a short time,\nhe had a Master-Servant relationship with her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "837172"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF were manipulated while their memories were hazy,\nbut #C236196003Shinji#CDEF may have decided to go along with it on his own."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "837344"
msgid "I'm surprised. Humans, coming all the way to a\nplace like this? And to expel a virus, no less?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "837440"
msgid "What did you come here for!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "837472"
msgid "Thank you SO very much for all the\nsneak attacks.\nYou hateful, spiky bitch!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "837548"
msgid "Hee hee. You don't need to tense up.\nThis me is just a virus.\nIt doesn't have the power my real body has."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "837656"
msgid "…I know now, but it's still terrifying."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "837700"
msgid "She exists like a flu, and once a lifeform contracts her,\nshe melts them down and takes them over.\nThis is how that person turned into #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "837864"
msgid "And by the looks of it, you're just a terminal.\nI'm not giving you or your blab the time of day.\nGet lost."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "837972"
msgid "Oh, my. Whether I get lost or not, I can't leave\nthis place. Since I'm going to be deleted after\nthis, why not have a chat with me?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "838104"
msgid "Goodness, you always keep busy.\nA disgraceful state for a disgraceful worm,\nhuh, #C236196003Shinji#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "838212"
msgid "W-what did you say…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "838236"
msgid "Isn't it so?\nDespite being so capable, your thought-routine\nis too subpar. You're defective."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "838332"
msgid "You're a prime example of a human being. You\nembody the masses. You're what I loathe most―\na mass of self-deceit and self-affirmation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "838468"
msgid "I assure you:\nhumans like you are evil. You're third-rates\nwho only consume, leaving nothing behind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "838572"
msgid "Think it over carefully, then go off to some\ncorner of the world and give in\nto your self-importance."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "838676"
msgid "――――――."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "838692"
msgid "#C236196003Shinji#CDEF bitterly grinds his teeth.\n#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF laughs him off, then turns around towards me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "838816"
msgid "She grins eerily, and so broadly it's as if her face was split.\nI can't stop the goosebumps all over my body."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "838928"
msgid "THIS one here is my favorite. Welcome to the\ninside of my body―――that's what I planned\nto say, but things didn't turn out so well."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "839064"
msgid "I failed to make #C236196003Sakura#CDEF into me.\nThis \"me\" that planned to turn into #C236196003Sakura#CDEF is\ngoing to just disappear, like some fly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "839216"
msgid "Hey, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF?\nConsidering my fate, won't you take pity\nand at least talk with me one last time?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "839328"
msgid "Hey, #C236196003Archer#CDEF?\nConsidering my fate, won't you take pity\nand at least talk with me one last time?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "839440"
msgid "…I'm deleting her.\nPresident, I'm withdrawing you immediately.\nAfter this, that #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF there will―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "839568"
msgid "…I'm deleting her.\nSenpai, I'm withdrawing you immediately.\nAfter this, that #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF there will―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "839692"
msgid "Are you alright with that, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF?\nYou can speak with me while I pose no danger to\nyou. This is your first and last chance."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "839832"
msgid "Is it wise to let that chance slip away\non account of that silly #C236196003White Sakura#CDEF's ego?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "839936"
msgid "She's clearly making fun of me, but this IS an opportunity.\nIf I can learn #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's train of thought―\nwhat her objective is―it'll serve us in the battle to come."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "840120"
msgid "It's my win.\nNow, I want to propose this again, but―――\n#C236196003#NICK#CDEF. I'm not speaking to you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "840228"
msgid "I'm only proposing this to #C236196003Archer#CDEF,\nstanding behind you. Don't get things mixed up.\nYou know you're a nuisance."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "840356"
msgid "…I want to send a signal to #C236196003Sakura#CDEF to\nimmediately unleash the bug spray, but I restrain myself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "840472"
msgid "I need to focus on staying quiet,\nfor the sake of winning in the end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "840544"
msgid "You understand how powerful I am, right?\nStop with the pointless resistance, #C236196003Archer#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "840648"
msgid "Eventually, I'll become everything.\nI will melt down everyone who loves you\nand turn them into me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "840748"
msgid "Everyone in the world will love you.\nYou and me, me and you.\nAll will be one, and one alone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "840844"
msgid "I will melt everything and turn it into #RUBSMeltlilith#RUBEme#REND.\nYou'll dream. Sweet dreams.\nSensual dreams; dreams of nectar."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "840976"
msgid "I hear her statement and grow wide-eyed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "841020"
msgid "Did she get caught up in her deeply emotional confession…?\nNo.\nDid #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF just flat-out reject #C236196003BB#CDEF…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "841160"
msgid "Yes. I don't need the black one or the white\none. I excel at managing humans,\nmore than them, after all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "841268"
msgid "Besides, if we leave #C236196003BB#CDEF alone,\nshe'll destroy herself.\nEven now, her self is disappearing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "841376"
msgid "Naturally. Why wouldn't her Spiritron-structure\ndeteriorate, doing all that? She'll downgrade\nto being a mere defense mechanism."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "841508"
msgid "She'll become the Moon's eyes, protecting the\nEarth it observes. She'll become a mere killing\nmachine, eliminating that cancer―humans."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "841644"
msgid "Salvaging submerged spirit bodies…!\nI'm going to begin exterminating the\nvirus via internal cleaning!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "841748"
msgid "Heh―――ahahahaha! That's fine, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF.\nYou DO serve the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF!\nMake no mistake as to where you stand…!"
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "841892"
msgid "The color switches seem to correspond to the doors.\nIt should be pretty simple as long as you don't rush."
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "842000"
msgid "Are the doors opening okay?\nModifying a person's body like this is just terrible!"
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "842084"
msgid "I-it's really weird being conscious of\nall this happening right now…"
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "842156"
msgid "Slight disturbances detected in the Cyber Frame.\nWhat happened, Sakura?"
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "842228"
msgid "My body is shaking… it feels so weird…"
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "842272"
msgid "I'm trying to devise a path to the door, but…\nArgh! There are way too many doors!!"
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "842356"
msgid "Seems she's waiting patiently for us.\nLet's show them what we can do, Master."
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "842436"
msgid "First, ascertain the rules, then construct a plan.\nThat or just wander around. It's a simple kid's puzzle."
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "842544"
msgid "Urgh, my stomach is squirming all about…\nPlease solve this quickly, okay…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "842624"
msgid "On second thought, I guess I should talk to him."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "842676"
msgid "Wha―― That you, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF!?\nOh thank God, finally someone who gets\nwhat I'm talking about!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "842784"
msgid "As soon as he sees me, #C236196003Shinji#CDEF's face starts to glow."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "842856"
msgid "He's barely said anything yet,\nbut just from his gestures I could tell that he's the\nsame #C236196003Shinji Matou#CDEF I saw in the \"previous school building.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "843016"
msgid "Even if that \"previous school building\" was a dream I had,\nthe actors in that dream were projections of those\nthat had I met in the \"real preliminaries.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "843172"
msgid "It's safe to say that this #C236196003Shinji#CDEF has\nthe same personality as I remember."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "843264"
msgid "So, same thing for you? When you came to,\nyou found yourself in this school building?\nHey, have you seen any sort of exit?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "843388"
msgid "I answer #C236196003Shinji#CDEF's question with a shake of my head."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "843456"
msgid "I explained that I had just woken up in this\nold school building, so I had yet to see an exit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "843552"
msgid "Shinji talks the same way he usually does."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "843596"
msgid "I know he's saying rude things,\nbut I don't feel any animosity towards him."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "843672"
msgid "It looks like I've gotten TOO used to his\nelitism and self-consciousness from my dream."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "843760"
msgid "…also, #C236196003Shinji#CDEF really IS brilliant, despite how he looks."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "843836"
msgid "Just like #C236196003Leo#CDEF asked of me,\nlet's try scouting him for the Student Council."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "843928"
msgid "Huh? Student Council?\nTeam up and work together so we can\nescape from here?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "844004"
msgid "Ha! No way! A Student Council isn't worth\na damn. If everyone wants to get all chummy\nto escape, then go right on ahead."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "844128"
msgid "I'm a genius, you know.\nI don't work with commoners.\nI won't ask for anyone's help, either."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "844220"
msgid "More importantly, this is the first I've\nheard of #C236196003Leo#CDEF being here! I despise that guy.\nSo smug. All cool and calm."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "844352"
msgid "If #C236196003Leo#CDEF got the boot and I'd be made President,\nI'd consider it. Until then,\ndon't come to me for anything, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "844484"
msgid "…he ended up rejecting me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "844512"
msgid "But just what does #C236196003Shinji#CDEF\nthink he's going to do all on his own?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "844596"
msgid "I know he's not great at making friends,\nbut I don't think it's smart to act tough\nin a situation like this…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "844708"
msgid "Let's put that aside. #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF,\ndo you remember the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "844808"
msgid "I answer by saying that I can't recall anything."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "844860"
msgid "I feel like I made it through several rounds with my Servant,\nbut so long as I don't know \"who\" or \"how\" I fought,\nI have nothing to tell #C236196003Shinji#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "845024"
msgid "The only real feeling I have left\nis the firm bond I have with #C236196003#SVT#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "845112"
msgid "I answer by saying that I can't recall anything."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "845164"
msgid "I feel like I made it through several rounds with my Servant,\nbut so long as I don't know \"who\" or \"how\" I fought,\nI have nothing to tell #C236196003Shinji#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "845328"
msgid "Obviously, being a Master and all, I reply.\n#C236196003Shinji#CDEF's astonishment was closer to fear than confusion."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "845448"
msgid "…yeah, sort of, I answer with little confidence."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "845500"
msgid "…gone. Apparently, we got separated\non the way here. Well, once I return to the\n#C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, she'll come back to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "845640"
msgid "…that's right, I need to hurry up and get back\nto the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF.#RUBS         I'm#RUBE Her Master's#REND not there.\nThat woman must be lonely in some dumb way…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "845824"
msgid "Besides, I'm sure the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF's still on.\nIf you're not on the final battlefield in\nseven days, you lose by default, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "845972"
msgid "A #C000246204seven day period#CDEF…\nA #C000246204final battlefield#CDEF… \nA #C000246204loss by absence#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "846084"
msgid "When I heard that, I remembered it too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "846124"
msgid "The #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF is a tournament with seven rounds.\nFirst, an opponent is decided for you.\nAfter seven days of preparation,\nyou go to the final battlefield and fight the enemy Master.\nThose are the rules."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "846348"
msgid "Naturally, losing this fight means elimination.\nNot reaching the final battlefield is also \"defeat.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "846452"
msgid "Ridiculous. Worst comes to worst,\nall you have to do is log out.\nIt's an old scare tactic."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "846544"
msgid "Sure, that could be how the final selection\nof the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF is.\nWorst comes to worst, you can just drop your connection\nand return to your body on Earth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "846720"
msgid "…however, they say that not a single #ROFS0001#RUBS  Magus#RUBE#C000246204Wizard#CDEF#REND who\nwent up to the Moon has ever returned from that cyberspace."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "846876"
msgid "And――The real problem is that we're\nin this school building, unable to get out."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "846960"
msgid "W-what's with that gloomy look on your face!?\nThere's probably just no connection\nbetween here and the surface."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "847072"
msgid "What? The #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF is a Brain of God, right?\nThen it'll help us soon enough."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "847168"
msgid "You're so damn persistent.\nA friendly little Student Council isn't\nmy thing. Can't you bother someone else?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "847276"
msgid "…like I thought,\nit sounds like #C236196003Shinji#CDEF has no intention of joining either."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "847368"
msgid "I'm sure I've already looked around the\nschool building from top to bottom,\nbut I haven't gotten very good responses."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "847488"
msgid "Let's stop by the Student Council Room to report to #C236196003Leo#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "847564"
msgid "First, we visit the Student Council.\nIf we all come up with another plan,\na way to beat #C236196003Rani#CDEF may arise."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "847684"
msgid "Or rather, we'll find a way.\nThough it's only chess, losing over and over\ngoes against every fiber of my being!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "847796"
msgid "About our issue with #C236196003Rani#CDEF: what if we challenge\nher to a game other than chess? I'm confident\nthat I'm second to none in Hanafuda…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "847944"
msgid "Did we have games with pieces back in\nancient Uruk, you ask? The answer is obvious."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "848028"
msgid "All of humanity's intellectual property, from\nall origins, come from my stores. That #C236196003King of\nConquerors#CDEF' library only imitates mine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "848180"
msgid "Heeeeeeeey!\nIt SURE DOES look like my time to shine, huh!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "848240"
msgid "Ah! #C236196003Shinji#CDEF…!?\nWhere did you come from…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "848300"
msgid "I was here the whole time!\nDo you know how many minutes\nI've been waiting here!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "848384"
msgid "#C236196003Shinji#CDEF, you… were waiting for me,\n#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "848484"
msgid "Why on Earth―― Well, that's what I would say,\nbut it's not really that strange.\nMaybe he was spying on the Student Council again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "848616"
msgid "Hmph――! I heard about it from #C236196003Sakura#CDEF.\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF? Chess? How no one could beat her?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "848728"
msgid "Hmph――! I heard about it from #C236196003Sakura#CDEF.\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF? Chess? How no one could beat her?\nAh, except for #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "848884"
msgid "I don't feel like joining in on your\npointless floundering, but I can't just\nignore a classmate in trouble, you know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "849004"
msgid "It won't hurt to show off what this\nNo. 1 Game Champ of Asia is made of.\nI'll lend you a hand, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "849124"
msgid "Oh my. I sense an indescribable vigor from this\nman… Listen, Praetor. Could this be the first\ntime he's been useful in his entire life?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "849264"
msgid "…I won't give him points for eavesdropping,\nbut it's good that he volunteered to cooperate.\nLet's see what he's got, I suppose."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "849396"
msgid "――――Hm.\nThough minuscule, I felt #ROFS0001#RUBSkingliness#RUBEan aura#REND……\nCould this \"#C236196003Shinji#CDEF\" be the King of Buffoons?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "849540"
msgid "Hmph. As usual, your Servant always\nhas something to say. Just you wait and see―\nthis time I'll show you how awesome I am…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "849668"
msgid "…hey, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF.\nHave your Servant and I\never spoken to each other before?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "849756"
msgid "Hey now, that Servant of yours\nhas a real sharp set of eyes on him!\nHe's all golden and looks tough…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "849860"
msgid "…whatever. Anyway, go on over to #C236196003Rani#CDEF.\nI'll be on standby in\nthe Student Council Room, got it!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "849976"
msgid "#C236196003Shinji#CDEF is full of energy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "850020"
msgid "Let's trust in the Game Champ's skills\nand try challenging #C236196003Rani#CDEF once again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "850112"
msgid "#C236196003Shinji#CDEF is standing in front of the room.\nBy the looks of it,\nit seems he wants to talk to me about something."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "850240"
msgid "Ever since the whole affair with #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF,\n#C236196003Shinji#CDEF has become increasingly obstinate."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "850360"
msgid "I wonder what #C236196003Shinji#CDEF wants to talk to me about,\nin spite of that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "850444"
msgid "#C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF's been keeping me in the loop.\nYou saw just how outclassed you are,\nyet you still went into HER Labyrinth, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "850580"
msgid "Not only did she treat me like a worm,\nshe even went and nano-sized me…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "850656"
msgid "If you had left me there, I'd be\nliquid nutrients for that #ROFS0002#RUBSSakura#RUBE#C236196003AI#CDEF#REND right about now.\nThinking about it makes me shudder."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "850820"
msgid "…so, how'd it go?\nYou entered her Labyrinth, so you fought her,\nright? Show me your battle logs."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "850920"
msgid "He doesn't know about #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's\nfighting style or her #C000246204invincibility#CDEF skill."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "851032"
msgid "How about we show him our previous data?\nThis man is a rather persistent one.\nHe'll keep asking and asking."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "851140"
msgid "Please show him our last battle records.\nWe might even get… probably nothing out of it,\nconsidering it's this guy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "851256"
msgid "*sigh* We haven't a single grain of obligation\nto tell you anything, but having you follow us\naround is SO annoying… Go ahead, Darling."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "851396"
msgid "It would clearly be in vain to do so, but\nthere's always a possibility. If all he desires\nis the battle data, then give it to him."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "851528"
msgid "Urged on by #C236196003#SVT#CDEF,\nI share my impressions of the time we were assaulted."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "851616"
msgid "Huh…?\nI knew about Drain, but what's up with that\n\"#C000246204Invincibility#CDEF\"? Is she really invincible?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "851728"
msgid "I can at least say that she nullified\neverything we threw at her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "851796"
msgid "Maybe she just has high defense,\nand if we get our attack stat up, we can break through…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "851888"
msgid "…all we can do is hope that's the case\nand head to the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "851956"
msgid "You've got some guts heading into\nthe Labyrinth with her after you…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "852028"
msgid "#C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF and #C236196003BB#CDEF both have awful personalities,\nbut SHE'S even worse than awful. You'll get\nslaughtered without mercy if she finds you…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "852200"
msgid "And you're going to beat THAT?\nDid #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF and the others come up\nwith some sort of strategy?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "852312"
msgid "They're coming up with one."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "852340"
msgid "But the hole #C236196003Leo#CDEF left behind is a big one.\nAll the work keeps piling up solely on #C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "852484"
msgid "I have no choice but to find a countermeasure\nfor #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF within the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "852584"
msgid "…unbelievable.\nAre you seriously not scared? You do realize\nwe have no chance of winning, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "852684"
msgid "Yet you're still going to defy #C236196003BB#CDEF?\n…the Near Side of the Moon\nain't that great a place, anyway."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "852800"
msgid "The #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF was an actual slaughterfest.\nEven if we make it back,\nwe'll either live or die. That's it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "852928"
msgid "I don't hear any of the usual bravado in #C236196003Shinji#CDEF's voice."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "853004"
msgid "In his own way, he's speaking his mind.\nHe's expressing his raw apprehensions without any pretense."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "853104"
msgid "I still have to get back to the Near Side."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "853148"
msgid "…to be honest, I'm scared too…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "853184"
msgid "…it's not that you want to go back,\nit's that you have to…\nWhat's the deal with you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "853272"
msgid "You're just #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nWhen did you start walking around,\nacting like a hero?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "853364"
msgid "That stuff about the end of humanity?\nIt's a load of bull.\nShe's totally just talking it up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "853460"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF is fundamentally the same as #C236196003Sakura#CDEF, right?\nSo it's fine. No way she's capable of\ndoing something that heinous."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "853608"
msgid "That's right, you should be.\nYou're up against a monster out to dominate\nthe #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF. No one can blame us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "853736"
msgid "You wouldn't be you otherwise, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF!\nThe fate of the world, protecting the Moon――\nIt's got nothing to do with us!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "853872"
msgid "…looks like my answer didn't get through to #C236196003Shinji#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "853944"
msgid "No matter what I say,\nthere are no words that will make #C236196003Shinji#CDEF feel better."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "854036"
msgid "That's something every person left in the\nold school building has in common, not just #C236196003Shinji#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "854148"
msgid "The ones remaining are those who stifle such thoughts\nand struggle on, and those who can no longer struggle on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "854260"
msgid "A-anyway, that's all I wanted to talk about.\nI want nothing to do with all this pointless\nfloundering about you're all doing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "854388"
msgid "I just got―you know―a bone to pick with HER.\nI was curious about what's been going on.\nThat's all this was, really!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "854508"
msgid "…you heard me? DON'T.\nIf you value your life, then do nothing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "854572"
msgid "#C236196003Shinji#CDEF leaves, like he was holding back his frustration."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "854648"
msgid "…don't go into the Labyrinth.\nIf we just stick to the old school building, we'll be safe…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "854740"
msgid "…it's absurd to imagine, but:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "854772"
msgid "maybe if we did as she said, our situation\nwouldn't have changed, and no one would've disappeared."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "854872"
msgid "It would've been like sleeping in an empty cradle."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "854924"
msgid "We wouldn't have known about the outside world's destruction.\nMaybe we would've slept as much as we wanted\nwithin this sunset school forever――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "855072"
msgid "But I've seen #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF go through\nthe cherry tree with that dinky face of #[his][hers]#.\nI need some info, stat…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "855200"
msgid "#C236196003Shinji#CDEF's in front of the Student Council Room.\nHe's trying to peek inside by looking for gaps in the curtains\none-by-one, unaware that I'm standing right behind him."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "855384"
msgid "Your face looks as sorry as ever, #[huh][doesn't it]#?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "855440"
msgid "\"Why?\" you ask……\nI AM involved in the Student Council,\nso of course I'd come through here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "855536"
msgid "And why're you here, #C236196003Shinji#CDEF?\nCould it be that you relate with #C236196003Rin#CDEF's #C000246204SG1#CDEF?\nSo, despite speaking ill of the Student Council,\nyou're actually interest――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "855736"
msgid "I mean, giving up on someone as uber talented\nas me after getting rejected one time?\nStudent Council messed up big time there."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "855864"
msgid "Like, do you really think I'M obligated\nto help them in any way? After all,\nthis problem'll go away if I just wait."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "855980"
msgid "That's why I'm only keeping an eye on you guys\nso you don't do anything excessive."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "856064"
msgid "I see……\nWould've been great if #C236196003Shinji#CDEF joined the Student Council,\nbut if he doesn't want to, he doesn't want to."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "856196"
msgid "Guess I'll keep doing whatever I can,\njust like I always have."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "856260"
msgid "How could you accept that so easily?\nCan't you…… do better than that!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "856336"
msgid "You really are a dunce, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nI really wanna see how you go about\ngetting your Student Council business done."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "856464"
msgid "Dumbass―― That wasn't what I…!\nSarcasm! That was SARCASM!\nDon't you get it!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "856544"
msgid "Arrrgh, whatever! No matter how many times\nyou invite me, it's not like I'd ever join\nyour little Student Council! Never ever!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "856672"
msgid "#C236196003Shinji#CDEF left while shouting at me.\n……I feel that somewhere in his heart,\nhe's got something similar to that aspect of #C236196003Rin#CDEF's."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "856832"
msgid "If I ever get stuck when I'm looking around,\nI might be able to ask #C236196003Shinji#CDEF for advice…… I think."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "856948"
msgid "Money? Come on #[man][girl]#,\nI already told you I wasn't gonna help out!\nWhy would I start handing out money?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "857060"
msgid "Besides, I'm the one strapped for some cash!\nI can't use my #RUBS  PPT#RUBEmoney#REND from the Near Side,\nand I can't find any extra memory anywhere!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "857212"
msgid "I don't have a Servant, so it'd be ridiculous\nfor me to start farming mats!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "857288"
msgid "…huff, huff… I did it…\nI was right all along… It takes a genius\nto know a genius… That's how it is…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "857396"
msgid "Now I can survive…\nThis'll end without me dying…\nNo, if I pull this off, I can…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "857480"
msgid "S-sorry about that. Just thinking about\nsome things. Looks like you're doing alright.\nYou insisted on surviving, again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "857600"
msgid "So, what are you all going to do now?\nYou were calling it the \"Student Council,\"\nbut #C236196003Leo#CDEF and #C236196003Julius#CDEF got done in, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "857752"
msgid "There's no way out of this now, right?\nAll you, #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF, and #C236196003Rani#CDEF can do now\nis whatever #C236196003BB#CDEF says."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "857900"
msgid "How about accepting it and preparing for\nher recommendation to surrender? Ya never know,\nshe might spare you, if you're lucky."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "858028"
msgid "……#C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF? She should still be in the #C000246204garden#CDEF.\nGo meet her if you want."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "858136"
msgid "In the first place, only second-rates\nhang out in stuff like Student Councils.\nI'll show you how I do things on my own."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "858256"
msgid "When the time comes to escape,\nI'll do you a favor and call out only to you,\n#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF. Be thankful."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "858372"
msgid "#C236196003Ms. Kiara#CDEF is also here in this school#REND, right?\nMaybe I'll pay her a visit later.\nI'm a bit worried, see."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "858500"
msgid "Huh? You're going to the Arena?\nThe #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF? You're able to go in\nthrough the schoolyard's cherry tree?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "858632"
msgid "So #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF is the culprit\nbehind this weird situation, right?\nMan, what the hell is she doing?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "858744"
msgid "Don't tell me, was she so scared of losing\nto me that she ran from the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF?\nAww, that's actually kinda cute!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "858880"
msgid "Ohh, #C000246204SG#CDEF, huh? Making walls in the Labyrinth\nout of the walls in people's hearts?\nWhat kind of shady joke is that?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "859012"
msgid "It's fine to ignore stuff like other people's\nfeelings. If there's an impassable wall,\nwhy not just smash it to pieces?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "859132"
msgid "I met with #C236196003Ms. Kiara#CDEF.\nI'm glad that she's alright.\nYeah, Teach's as nice as ever……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "859236"
msgid "…hmph. Couldn't find an exit\nno matter how hard I searched.\nBut help should be coming soon, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "859336"
msgid "No way would the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF abandon me.\nOnly idiots run around risking their lives."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "859436"
msgid "Then again, fussing over things like that\nis just like you, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF. Hahaha!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "859528"
msgid "What's up with that damn #C236196003BB#CDEF…!?\nThe nerve to hack our five senses and tout\nher shitty AI self as someone important…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "859664"
msgid "Shit, I can't stop shaking……\n'cause of that violent hack,\nI still can't feel my arms n' legs yet…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "859768"
msgid "She honestly thinks she can make\na fool out of me! If I just had #C236196003Rider#CDEF,\nI'd blow that bitch away!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "859884"
msgid "And what's with \"#C236196003Mr. Shinji-boy#CDEF,\" huh?\nShe making fun of me!?\nI'd rather she just picked one!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "859996"
msgid "Pfft. That's great.\nYou'll be needing my help soon, I'm guessing?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "860064"
msgid "She called herself #C236196003Matou#CDEF all on her own.\nShe's not my little sister or anything."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "860164"
msgid "…I guess she is pretty quiet and\nunderstanding. It's not like I hate her type…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "860248"
msgid "But, uh, isn't she a little scary?\nLike she's a landmine, or has a scary smile…?\nAnyways, I'm not related to her!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "860364"
msgid "This uniform? Yeah, when I came to\nI was in this uniform. Probably got it\naround the time I arrived in this school."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "860480"
msgid "Since it's got the same performance,\nI don't really care if the design is different."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "860568"
msgid "But… I never wore anything like a uniform\nuntil I joined the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "860664"
msgid "…h-hmmph. Having fun, aren't you\n#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF? #C000246204Habit of Exposure#CDEF, huh…\nIt's a very \"adult\" taste…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "860792"
msgid "Huh!? N-nah, I just happened to overhear it!\nI don't even go near the Student Council Room,\nokay!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "860892"
msgid "Hmph. Keeping your nose on the grindstone, huh?\nYou being a pleb and all,\nhonest, hard work is right up your alley."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "861008"
msgid "Will the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF come to save us first,\nor will you guys clear the Labyrinth first?\nI'll be watching to see what happens."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "861148"
msgid "But just you wait. No doubt that, one day,\nI'll give her a run for her money in chess!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "861236"
msgid "Hehe. My father taught me how to play chess\nwhen I was five years old."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "861308"
msgid "At last, it's time for the main act.\nTHAT means it's #C236196003Shinji Matou#CDEF's turn.\nI'll show you what I can do!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "861428"
msgid "…in the end,\nno one was able to beat #C236196003Rani#CDEF at chess, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "861504"
msgid "…in the end,\nno one was able to beat #C236196003Rani#CDEF at chess, right?\nAh, other than #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF, I guess."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "861632"
msgid "…don't finish your sentence, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nYou need my help, right?\nI'll do it, I'll play some chess."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "861748"
msgid "…the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF still isn't coming, huh…\nCould it be…\nIt's really not coming to save us?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "861856"
msgid "Shit…! That \"#C000246204BB Channel#CDEF\"\ndoesn't give a damn even if you're outside\nthe Student Council Room!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "861968"
msgid "Ugh… Sorry, I feel awful right now…\nNever even got nauseous when I was playing\n3D FPS games…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "862064"
msgid "Things are looking real dodgy now…\nYou really gonna be alright? If it's too much,\nisn't this a good time to throw in the towel?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "862196"
msgid "W-well, whatever. Do what you want.\nYou're all hogging the Student Council Room,\nso it's your job to find the exit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "862312"
msgid "#C236196003Ms. Kiara#CDEF's skill can open up Shields in\nthe #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF, right? I knew #C236196003Ms. Kiara#CDEF\nwas different from the others."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "862480"
msgid "…but that Servant is the worst.\nI went to talk to #C236196003Ms. Kiara#CDEF, and he tore me\nopen a new one with his criticisms!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "862612"
msgid "Agh! It pisses me off so much!\nHe looks pretty similar to me on the outside,\nso who does he think he is!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "862720"
msgid "Stolen memories?\nI guess if you say you'll give them to me,\nI'll take 'em off your hands."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "862812"
msgid "But is it really alright? If you recall\nmemories of the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, you might\nend up bawling your eyes out, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "862964"
msgid "After all, I've been kicking asses without\ntaking names, so I must've had you checkmated!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "863056"
msgid "Nah, nah. It's all good. Even when we\nget our memories back, we're still pals.\nI'll treat you like I have been up until now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "863184"
msgid "Yeah… I'm winning again and again…\nOf course I'll keep winning…\nI'm the top pick of this tournament…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "863292"
msgid "But… #C236196003Leo#CDEF and #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF are saying different\nthings… Imaginary number spaces, the #C000246204Far Side#CDEF…\n…why the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF won't intervene…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "863488"
msgid "…no, I better stop. If I think about it\ntoo seriously, I'll have nightmares…\nIt can't be… it can't…."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "863596"
msgid "Listen here. I know plebs envy the talented.\nAnd I'm an adult, so I'll\nlet this be water under the bridge."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "863704"
msgid "But come on! Is there no way everyone can\nSTOP FORGETTING about me!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "863776"
msgid "Even in the Student Council Room,\nmy name NEVER gets brought up!\nYou can't exclude people, it's not nice!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "863884"
msgid "No need for me to even lift a finger.\nYou'll wipe the floor with that nasty AI\nfor us in no time, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "863992"
msgid "W-was someone outta this world in the schoolyard\njust now!? They had a Spiritron structure\nbeyond a Servant's―the hell are they…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "864128"
msgid "Since you have a Servant with you,\nyou're obligated to fight in my place.\nJust don't go dying in vain."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "864232"
msgid "Huh? You're gonna take #C236196003Jinako#CDEF to the\n#C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF? That's a strategy even\nI wouldn't be able to manage."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "864372"
msgid "If you're gonna take #C236196003Jinako#CDEF, then you'd have\na hell of an easier time taking one of\nthose trees in the schoolyard, instead!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "864512"
msgid "Hmph. Wondering about what I'm doing here?\nI'm not exactly staring at the sunset\nand getting all down."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "864616"
msgid "This spot gets good reception. I can't take\nover the old school's system, it's being\nmanaged by the Student Council and #C236196003Sakura#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "864760"
msgid "But, though slowly, I can gather Sakurament\nwhen I stand here! Geniuses don't need to even\nlift a finger, see?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "864872"
msgid "Just you wait, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nWith all the power source I'll stockpile,\nI'll whip up a special #C236196003Shinji Matou#CDEF#RUBS  technique#RUBE program#REND!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "865040"
msgid "You're not shrewd enough to know to run\nfrom a situation like that.\nYou must've had no choice… right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "865144"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF, huh…\nShe's an oddball, but she's still a Game Champ.\nShe won't go down so easy…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "865260"
msgid "…oh, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nWord is you're going to break open\nthat memory data you got."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "865352"
msgid "…#C000246204let's go to the Student Council Room#CDEF.\nYou're the only people I don't want getting\na one-up on me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "865468"
msgid "Aww, damn… damn… damn…!\nI should've never gone through with it\nif THIS was going to happen!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "865564"
msgid "…didn't I tell you not to talk to me?\nCan you not remember squat, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "865656"
msgid "Ha! You can't, can you!\nYou remembered everything BUT yourself!\nIt's plastered all over your face!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "865756"
msgid "MAN. Same old, same old, huh!?\nYou're such a wimp that it pisses me off,\nso take a hike in the Labyrinth or something!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "865876"
msgid "That explains why she had over 6,000 hours\nof playtime in FA. The Total Champ turned out\nto be a pretty lonely person…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "865996"
msgid "Damn! Now I went and remembered it again!\nI was finally starting to calm down, too!\nDamn it, damn it!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "866100"
msgid "I'm not like him. I'm special.\nI'm going to get out of this alive,\nno matter what…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "866188"
msgid "………what is it? Can't you see me\nthinking here? If you want some friends,\nhow about you try the Student Council Room?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "866308"
msgid "Yo, if it isn't #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nGood job crawling back out of rock bottom.\nSo, what's the plan now?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "866416"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF is gone and #C236196003Julius#CDEF is gone.\nWe have no chance of winning, anyway."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "866520"
msgid "Well, if it comes to that,\nwe'll be living like chained slaves, though!\nHahaha!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "866600"
msgid "I knew the differences between\nplebs and geniuses, but THIS was REAL cruel.\nWoe to the unchosen guys."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "866704"
msgid "#C236196003Ms. Kiara#CDEF is dead…?\nYou're joking… #C236196003BB#CDEF said as long as we don't\noppose her, she won't kill us…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "866836"
msgid "Shit! So that's how it is!?\nIn the end, we're all going to… Damn it!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "866908"
msgid "I know. Not only was I useless,\nbut on top of betraying you,\nI proactively got in your way!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "867000"
msgid "I'm the very definition of a silly clown!\nEnough, please stop treating me like an ally!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "867088"
msgid "C'mon, please stay away from me!\nI'm the one turning down your pity!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "867160"
msgid "Like I said yesterday,\ndon't go to the Labyrinth anymore.\nThat way none of us have to die……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "867256"
msgid "I've done what I needed to do.\nI'll haul ass after I take a breather."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "867328"
msgid "………………well.\nPlaying friends with each other\nwasn't so boring after all, huh…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "867416"
msgid "Oh, what's up, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF?\nThat outfit sure takes me back.\nFelt like the preliminaries for a bit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "867528"
msgid "Eh? You found that in the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF? \nYou can really find anything over there, \ncan't you…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "867644"
msgid "How to uncover #C236196003Rani#CDEF's #C000246204SG#CDEF, hm……?\nWe don't seem to have any leads at the moment."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "867760"
msgid "The #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF is the projection of a\nyoung girl's mind, which has become a Core.\nWe can only hope for a clue in the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "867912"
msgid "#C236196003Rani#CDEF's secret… #C236196003Rani#CDEF's secret, huh…\nI feel as if the other two were like,\n\"Oh, yeah…\" but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "868040"
msgid "That would be big trouble for us. If she herself\nhas a secret she doesn't know about, no amount\nof poking or prodding may do any good…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "868176"
msgid "Lady #C236196003Rani#CDEF's secret… Well, this is just my\nimpression, but she has an avid thirst for\nknowledge. A \"know-it-all,\" if you will."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "868320"
msgid "I interpreted her first #C000246204SG#CDEF to be, essentially,\nthe desire for a prince on a white stallion.\nThus… the third may be surprisingly childish."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "868476"
msgid "Though she appears to be one without pity,\nperhaps she merely has yet to learn a way\nto express her emotions?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "868588"
msgid "You want to know about my secrets…?\nUs AI have a duty to answer any question,\nso strictly speaking, I have none."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "868704"
msgid "However, there are some matters in which we've\nbeen preset to keep silent on. Private matters\n―those would count as secrets to us AI."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "868840"
msgid "If #C236196003Rani#CDEF is somewhat like us,\nthen I don't believe that she would ever\ntalk about her own secrets."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "868956"
msgid "I'm unable to define whether such instability\nis merely error, or something of the mind,\nthough…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "869056"
msgid "What is it, anyway? About #C236196003Rani#CDEF's secret?\nJust rile her up somehow\nand it'll all come tumbling out, duh."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "869176"
msgid "You're saying to challenge her to a competition?\nThat IS one idea. But, one thing…\nwhy is it that YOU know about our troubles?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "869304"
msgid "…a typical communication style for youth\nin the internet age… but #C236196003Shinji#CDEF:\nhow come you know what we're investigating?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "869440"
msgid "Amuse her with a gamble, and expose her\ntrue colors… Yes, the basics are there. But,\nwhy do YOU know of #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF's troubles?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "869584"
msgid "B-by accident! I just happened to overhear\nwhen I was in front of the Student Council Room!\nI don't want to join you guys or anything!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "869720"
msgid "Hm? You say you want to know #C236196003Rani#CDEF's secret?\nYou… Again you're becoming more of an\naudacious #[manly man][Amazoness]#――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "869860"
msgid "…hmph. I do owe you for saving me, and\nthis could be a chance to flaunt my strength\nif I can do it, but forget it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "869976"
msgid "I, #C236196003Monji Gatou#CDEF, am hopelessly clueless\nwhen it comes to the minds of women!\nEven Homer sometimes nods―― Gahahahaha!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "870112"
msgid "I know, since I've been monitoring.\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF's last secret, right?\nMmm…. Can't really say I'm sure."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "870228"
msgid "…let's see.\nThat young lady puts the conclusion\nfar too ahead of everything else."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "870312"
msgid "Discernment over intuition,\nchoice by necessity over chance.\nWhat happens when one lives as such, #C236196003Jinako#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "870436"
msgid "Heck if I know.\nI'm pretty sure I told you not to redirect\nevery single topic over to #C236196003Jinako#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "870548"
msgid "…lose the experience of defeat, you mean.\nWhen those who possess great insight evade\ndefeat too much, they unfamiliarize it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "870676"
msgid "Victory is assured when it involves one's\nexpertise. If the result turns out unlike what\nshe expects, you may see signs of her mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "870812"
msgid "…sorry, I said too much.\nAfter all, we merely observed over the monitor.\nI don't want you to take it to heart."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "870924"
msgid "\"A maiden's secret\"? Ha! No need to mull\nover it for even a second! You really thought\nI would want to know something like that!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "871056"
msgid "A young girl's troubles can always fall\ninto one of three groups: troubles over her\nface, over her chest, or over boys!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "871176"
msgid "There's no other topic as worthless to study!\nIf you want some fortune telling on love,\nask someone else. It's not my act to play in."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "871312"
msgid "…I apologize. As you can see,\ndiscussions about innocent boys and girls\nputs him in a worse mood than usual."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "871424"
msgid "But hey, #C236196003Andersen#CDEF?\nThere's no special reason why #C236196003Rani#CDEF would\nhave a secret about love, you know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "871552"
msgid "Such is the mind of a maiden, casually\nleveraging her assets to entice her interest.\nGood lord, she's so proud her face is frozen!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "871684"
msgid "Hypothetically, if ever there was a writer who\nwould do that, then they should hurry and settle\ndown and switch to making documentaries."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "871824"
msgid "The light of the Code Cast fades,\nand I see a different landscape laid out before me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "871912"
msgid "We're inside #C236196003Sakura#CDEF…\nNot inside a body of flesh, but rather inside a digital frame.\nThere's nothing grotesquely graphic\nabout this digitized structure."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "872084"
msgid "Mhm. I'm fine, as well.\nWe're inside a young girl―――I expected it\nto be more lewd, but it's quite clean."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "872192"
msgid "Hmm. Looks like I'm alright too. Still…\nI know it's a \"digital frame,\" but I never\nthought I would ever explore inside someone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "872324"
msgid "ENTER: #C236196003Cas-ko#CDEF～! I'm in tip-top shape;\nrefilled #RUBS     MP   #RUBEmagical energy#REND; absolutely no issues!\n…hey, this place is pretty desolate."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "872492"
msgid "It appears I converted safely.\nIt's nothing special for a Master and Servant\nto share minds, but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "872592"
msgid "To enter someone's Spiritron structure,\nand remain firmly independent, is seldom seen.\nI'll enjoy this for the time being."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "872716"
msgid "Looks like #C236196003#SVT#CDEF can materialize normally.\nOkay, let's quickly get rid of this virus――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "872820"
msgid "Took you long enough, #[piggy][squirrely]#.\nWhat's the big idea with making me wait?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "872908"
msgid "Hmph. Not a very perceptive farm animal,\nare you? If I'm here, that means only\none thing: I changed managers."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "873020"
msgid "Yes. That woman is my manager now.\nShe's pretty awful, isn't she?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "873088"
msgid "See, after she melted me down,\nshe reconstructed me as a virus for her to use."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "873168"
msgid "Thanks to that, here I am.\nI became nanosized, and now I'm hacking\nthis girl's body."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "873256"
msgid "Since we're infiltrating a digital body,\nit makes sense for us to be about that size…\nbut I get the sense that we're playing by different rules."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "873404"
msgid "For #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF, it looks like she entered\nthis Cyber Frame as her whole self. Basically,\nshe's the boss of the Melt-Virus."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "873544"
msgid "Hm… There are some noisy people outside.\nBe quiet, will you? Make too much trouble for\nme, and I'll kill this host instantly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "873672"
msgid "Yep. Killing her would be easy enough. A blow to\nthe brain will turn her into an invalid. I\nwon't, though, since this body belongs to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "873812"
msgid "I won't be a Servant restricted by a Master.\nI'll be able to live whole and free\nas a lifeform rooted in this world!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "873932"
msgid "You mean you'll hijack #C236196003Sakura#CDEF…\nan AI, so you can be reborn?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "874012"
msgid "Yep. She's not as nice as me, but she has a\npretty face. Once the virus circulates through-\nout her body, my data will overwrite her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "874148"
msgid "This can't be happening… At this rate,\nwe won't just lose #C236196003Sakura#CDEF―we'll gain another enemy…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "874260"
msgid "Did you forget? I can do this at any\nmoment and have you killed off."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "874332"
msgid "Before long, the border of your ego will finish\nmelting. You'll be gone either way, so you\ndon't want it to hurt, too, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "874460"
msgid "This is a disaster for you two, as well. There's\nnothing left for you to do but melt away inside\nme. …hmph. That's what you get for meddling."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "874604"
msgid "So this will be our fate, after all.\nBut she was acting a little…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "874672"
msgid "She goes insane after getting backed\ninto a wall?\nBut……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "874732"
msgid "See? That's the kind of woman she is.\nBut something feels a little off…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "874808"
msgid "…she's not as lenient as she usually is.\nWhich means we both have our backs\nagainst the wall."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "874904"
msgid "Looks like we're racing against time. \nLet's head quickly for the end."
msgstr ""

